claim.claim-text:
a submerged combustion melter (10) having a housing (26) that defines an interior reaction chamber (34), a feed material inlet (46) for introducing a vitrifiable feed material (14) into the interior reaction chamber (34), and a molten glass outlet (48) for discharging unrefined molten glass from the interior reaction chamber (34), the submerged combustion melter (10) further comprising one or more submerged burners (62);
a stilling vessel (12) that includes a stilling tank (70) and a feeding spout (72), the stilling tank (70) having a housing (74) that defines a stilling chamber (82), an inlet (86), and an outlet (88), and the feeding spout (72) being appended to the stilling tank (70) so as to cover the outlet (88) of the stilling tank (70), the feeding spout (72) having a spout bowl (98) and an orifice plate (100) defining at least one orifice (118) for delivering a molten glass feed out of the feeding spout (72); and
a conduit that interconnects the submerged combustion melter (10) and the stilling vessel (12) and establishes fluid communication between the interior reaction chamber (34) and the stilling chamber (82) and that defines a flow path (124) from the molten glass outlet (48) of the submerged combustion melter (10) to the inlet (86) of the stilling tank (70) of the stilling vessel (12).
